## Client Secret

Your `client_secret` was shown **once** in the OnboardingWizard.

To activate this agent:
1. Create `.env.secret` in this directory (see `.env.secret.example`)
2. Paste your `tp_secret_...` value as `CLIENT_SECRET`

The MCP server uses this secret to obtain agent JWTs automatically.

## Security Notes

- `CLIENT_ID` is semi-public (appears in agent cards) — safe in `.env`
- `CLIENT_SECRET` is a credential — only in `.env.secret` (gitignored)
- Agent JWTs are cached in MCP server memory — never written to disk
- The MCP server only calls `{{ registry_url }}` — no internal registry paths
